## Rules
- Write both new files using the Write tool
- Edit the module .cpp with the Edit tool
- Use `FCoreStyle::GetDefaultFontStyle()` for ALL fonts — never reference Roboto .ttf paths
- Include `"Styling/CoreStyle.h"` for `FCoreStyle` access
